We rest for a little while.
We move to the side of the court.
Kochi is very hot right now.
I drink some water.
Vishnu, Sara, and Kiran drink water.
Vishnu looks at me and smiles.
Vishnu says, "Maya, you play very well."
I smile and say, "Thank you very much, Vishnu."
"I like to play badminton very much."
Sara asks, "Can you play every day?"
I reply, "No, I have work every day."
"I like to play sports to relax after work."
Kiran says, "We also like to play in the evening."
I say, "I can play well with you."
Sara happily says, "That is very good."
We finish drinking water.
Vishnu asks, "Are we going to play again?"
We walk back to the court.
We are going to play badminton again.
